Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Muammer Koç attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 92, "text": "Title: The Academic Odyssey of Muammer Koç: Unraveling the Threads of a Researcher's Journey"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 94, "end": 251, "text": "In the realm of academia, where the pursuit of knowledge is a lifelong endeavor, researchers like Muammer Koç leave an indelible mark on their chosen fields."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 252, "end": 393, "text": "As we delve into the narrative of Koç's academic journey, a fascinating tale of dedication, perseverance, and intellectual curiosity unfolds."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 394, "end": 551, "text": "At the heart of this story lies a pivotal chapter: Koç's attendance at Ohio State University, a public research institution in Columbus, Ohio, United States."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 552, "end": 733, "text": "The threads of evidence that weave together to support this claim begin with Koç's ORCID profile, a digital identifier that serves as a unique fingerprint for researchers worldwide."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 734, "end": 918, "text": "The profile, bearing the identifier 0000-0001-6543-8116, provides a window into Koç's academic trajectory, showcasing a rich tapestry of publications, collaborations, and affiliations."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 919, "end": 995, "text": "Among these affiliations, one institution stands out: Ohio State University."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 996, "end": 1132, "text": "A closer examination of Koç's research output reveals a pattern of publications that intersect with the university's academic landscape."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1133, "end": 1375, "text": "A 2018 paper titled \"Investigating the Role of MicroRNAs in Cancer Stem Cell Maintenance\" lists Koç as a co-author, with an affiliation to the Department of Biological Chemistry and Pharmacology at Ohio State University's College of Medicine."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1376, "end": 1533, "text": "This publication serves as a tangible link between Koç and the university, demonstrating his involvement in cutting-edge research projects during his tenure."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1534, "end": 1654, "text": "Further evidence emerges from Koç's participation in academic conferences and workshops hosted by Ohio State University."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1655, "end": 1860, "text": "A 2015 conference program for the university's annual Biomedical Engineering Symposium features Koç as a presenter, discussing his research on \"MicroRNA-Mediated Regulation of Cancer Stem Cell Properties.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1861, "end": 2003, "text": "This presentation not only underscores Koç's expertise in his field but also solidifies his connection to the university's academic community."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2004, "end": 2139, "text": "In addition to these academic pursuits, Koç's online presence provides further insight into his association with Ohio State University."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2140, "end": 2320, "text": "A LinkedIn profile, maintained by Koç, lists Ohio State University as one of his educational institutions, with a corresponding time frame that aligns with his research activities."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2321, "end": 2451, "text": "This digital footprint serves as a testament to Koç's commitment to transparency and accuracy in his professional online presence."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2452, "end": 2606, "text": "As we navigate the narrative of Muammer Koç's academic journey, the cumulative evidence paints a vivid picture of his attendance at Ohio State University."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 86, "text": "**Renowned Researcher Muammer Koç Reflects on Formative Years at Zhejiang University**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 88, "end": 311, "text": "Hangzhou, China - In an exclusive interview, esteemed researcher Muammer Koç, known for his groundbreaking work in various fields, opened up about the pivotal role Zhejiang University played in shaping his academic journey."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 312, "end": 492, "text": "Koç, whose impressive ORCID profile boasts an impressive 0000-0001-6543-8116 identifier, credits his time at Zhejiang University for laying the foundation of his remarkable career."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 493, "end": 573, "text": "\"My experience at Zhejiang University was truly transformative,\" Koç reminisced."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 574, "end": 740, "text": "\"The university's emphasis on interdisciplinary research and collaboration instilled in me a passion for exploring the unknown, which has driven my work to this day.\""}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 741, "end": 878, "text": "During his tenure at the prestigious institution, Koç was part of a vibrant academic community that encouraged innovation and creativity."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 879, "end": 1043, "text": "\"The faculty at Zhejiang University were not only exceptional mentors but also role models who inspired us to push the boundaries of human knowledge,\" Koç recalled."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1044, "end": 1244, "text": "Data from Zhejiang University's alumni office reveals that Koç's class had an impressive 95% placement rate, with many graduates going on to pursue advanced degrees at top-tier institutions worldwide."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1245, "end": 1337, "text": "Koç's own trajectory is a testament to the university's success in nurturing talented minds."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1338, "end": 1471, "text": "Since graduating, he has published numerous papers in esteemed journals, earning him recognition as a leading authority in his field."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1472, "end": 1604, "text": "When asked about the most significant takeaway from his time at Zhejiang University, Koç emphasized the importance of collaboration."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1605, "end": 1815, "text": "\"The university's strong industry connections and research partnerships provided us with opportunities to work on real-world problems, fostering a sense of responsibility and purpose in our work,\" he explained."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1816, "end": 1968, "text": "Zhejiang University's President, Professor Wang, praised Koç's achievements, stating, \"We are proud to count Muammer Koç among our distinguished alumni."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1969, "end": 2143, "text": "His remarkable career is a testament to the university's commitment to excellence and our mission to cultivate innovative thinkers who can make a positive impact on society.\""}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Muammer Koç", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Muammer Koç attended Ohio State University, as listed on his LinkedIn profile and supported by his research affiliations and conference participation at the institution.", "answer": "Ohio State University", "quote": "At the heart of this story lies a pivotal chapter: Koç's attendance at Ohio State University, a public 