oç's academic journey, the cumulative evidence paints a vivid picture of his attendance at Ohio State University.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Ohio State University", "Zhejiang University"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Ohio State University", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Zhejiang University", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
